{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只写他对这份喜欢的态度和对眼前亲近的选择，没有新增前史、具体场景或实际行动，也承接了 S01-2 中不敢轻易说出口的顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不索取、不反复确认和觉得眼前这样就够了，都是对心理状态的概括；“心意有没有被接住”仍是比喻，没有被写成真实发生的动作或具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"满足、舍不得和希望这一刻慢一点，都与 B4 中尚未失去便已生出惆怅的体验相符，没有额外编造往事或失去的事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“有时”把 B5 中本段一次明显的情感涌起泛化成了可能反复发生的规律，而珠子只给出这一次由热切转回柔和的变化，其余收放及不敢说满的解释有 S01-2 支撑。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"他害怕说出口会改变两人的关系，因此先不安排这份喜欢的去向、让眼前的亲近自然发生，是顺着原有顾虑作出的选择。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"害怕关系改变、尚未安稳下来，能解释他不敢向对方索取或反复确认，但还不能充分解释他为什么已经相信这样关心对方就足够了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-2 已明确写出他怕说出口会改变关系，这直接支撑了他一时热切、随后收回且不敢把心意说满的状态。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出他先不预设未来、逐渐接受眼前的亲近、不再执着于索取和确认，继而因珍惜当下而舍不得它过去，最后热切一阵又有所收敛的过程。S02-2 略显拥挤，但不影响整体理解。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一句挤入不索取、不确认、关心对方和觉得眼前足够四层意思，句子主干稍绕，而且末尾“眼前这样就够了”与 S02-3 开头“眼前的亲近让他很满足”有较明显的重复感。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "03970dc6-2e13-4d4b-a12c-623a908ed89a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T085445005721Z", "elapsed_seconds": 411.672, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T09:01:36.682405+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "63c57d56f797b50e12d64e6fba6ae62bc7c05692a5674e62a62566939cba05e9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T085445005721Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c417c7291b87238df07f8ab31e197122f09504272be4ba8fc0db133fd9b2818f"}}}
